sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gen as Event Simulator
    participant Kaf as Kafka (raw-events)
    participant Fln as Flink Processing
    participant Val as Validation Engine
    participant Ice as Iceberg Lakehouse
    participant Qrn as Quarantine Store
    participant Obs as Observability & Metrics
    participant Inc as Incident Manager
    participant Alt as Slack Alerting
    participant Rec as Recovery Workflow

    Gen->>Kaf: 1. Publish Event Payload
    Kaf->>Fln: 2. Consume Raw Event Stream
    Fln->>Val: 3. Parse & Evaluate Quality Rules
    
    alt Event is Valid
        Val->>Ice: 4a. Write Valid Record to Lakehouse
    else Event is Invalid
        Val->>Qrn: 4b. Divert Invalid Record to Quarantine
        Val->>Obs: 5. Increment Windowed Error Rate
    end

    opt Error Rate Exceeds Threshold
        Obs->>Inc: 6. Trigger Circuit Breaker OPEN & Create Incident
        Inc->>Alt: 7. Dispatch Alert Notification to Slack
        Alt->>Rec: 8. Trigger Recovery Validation & Half-Open Check
        Rec->>Kaf: 9. Replay Corrected Quarantine Payload
        Rec->>Obs: 10. Reset Circuit Breaker to CLOSED & Resume Ingestion
    end
